WEBVTT

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:22.122
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:26.626
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:30.697
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:35.301
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:43.343
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:54.117
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:58.558
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:02.996
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:07.067
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:14.735
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:46.873
This person...

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:48.636
That is Rona Fauna.

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:07.619
What are you trying to do?

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:08.759
Stop this already!

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:14.289
Stop this, Rona!

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:31.548
Emotions That Fall Short

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:39.550
Thank you.

00:02:40.126 --> 00:02:41.388
I'm fine now.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.294
Is the problem solved now?

00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:50.364
She is Rona Fauna.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:51.337
However...

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:52.304
Stop.

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:54.301
Forget I asked.

00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:58.800
Even if I hear what you have to say,
it'll just confuse me more.

00:02:59.012 --> 00:02:59.706
Pardon me.

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:03.213
For now, let's go as far as we can get.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:07.153
Our job isn't to finish off Rona Fauna anyway,

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:09.144
and I want to join up with Hono quickly.

00:03:09.923 --> 00:03:12.050
Teacher, please stay here.

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:14.527
You can't make it in your condition.

00:03:14.527 --> 00:03:16.688
What could you possibly do alone?!

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:18.127
I'll manage.

00:03:18.898 --> 00:03:20.229
Manage, huh?

00:03:20.466 --> 00:03:23.526
Well, at least it doesn't
seem like you'd die easily.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.735
Yes, I won't die.

00:03:35.882 --> 00:03:36.678
Teacher?

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:38.507
I'll take you up on it.

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:42.477
In all honesty, it's tough just being on my feet.

00:03:42.555 --> 00:03:45.149
Please rest with Mr. Bogie.

00:03:45.458 --> 00:03:47.358
You need not worry about me.

00:03:58.705 --> 00:03:59.729
Damn it.

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:04.670
If I let him go by himself, he'll be
alone with Hono on the way back.

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.840
This person is Rona Fauna...

00:04:11.451 --> 00:04:12.440
But...

00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:16.688
Rona Fauna died over a year ago.

00:04:18.491 --> 00:04:22.595
Immediately after her death,
her body was preserved.

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:23.527
That is what this is.

00:04:24.631 --> 00:04:26.997
Why do you know that?

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.626
Have you ever heard of the wormhole driver?

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:34.874
It is the ultimate weapon of
destruction under The Third's control.

00:04:34.874 --> 00:04:36.432
A space shattering cannon.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:40.713
Rona Fauna hijacked this
wormhole driver's system,

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:42.738
paralyzing The Third.

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:45.148
So she threatened them?

00:04:45.718 --> 00:04:46.685
Yes.

00:04:47.186 --> 00:04:51.850
The wormhole driver is a weapon
capable of destroying this very planet.

00:04:52.592 --> 00:04:53.650
This planet?

00:04:54.227 --> 00:04:54.852
Yes.

00:04:56.663 --> 00:04:57.561
Why?!

00:04:57.797 --> 00:04:59.628
Why would they make something like that?!

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:04.331
The Third are already completely
in control of this planet!

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:07.103
What more do they want to
do with something like that?!

00:05:07.373 --> 00:05:09.364
They have no intention of destroying the planet.

00:05:09.776 --> 00:05:11.744
Then, what for?!

00:05:11.944 --> 00:05:15.107
As I said, it is to keep anyone from interfering.

00:05:15.748 --> 00:05:17.340
Interfering? With what?

00:05:18.584 --> 00:05:20.753
If she's supposed to be Rona Fauna,

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:22.584
then who the heck is holding Joganki captive?

00:05:23.289 --> 00:05:24.586
Who attacked Fila Marique?!

00:05:25.325 --> 00:05:27.589
Who's the mastermind behind all this?!

00:05:28.094 --> 00:05:30.187
Rona Fauna is Rona Fauna!

00:05:40.807 --> 00:05:42.297
As I suspected, huh?

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:46.176
Blue Breaker's artificial
brain had been taken over.

00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:49.749
At the point when he disobeyed her
instructions and came into the room,

00:05:49.749 --> 00:05:51.546
Honoka intuitively knew this to be true.

00:05:52.719 --> 00:05:56.723
His explanations concerning the
wormhole driver and Rona Fauna...

00:05:56.723 --> 00:06:00.056
...were also not information a mere
autonomous soldier would know.

00:06:05.031 --> 00:06:06.794
What's this? You're all beat-up.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.065
You're one to talk.

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:12.037
You really won, huh?

00:06:12.572 --> 00:06:13.766
I believe I said I would.

00:06:14.407 --> 00:06:17.103
So, have you been able to contact Hono?

00:06:18.711 --> 00:06:19.939
Not yet.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.710
So the signal jamming is still around.

00:06:25.752 --> 00:06:26.719
Which means...

00:06:28.588 --> 00:06:31.056
...she wasn't Rona Fauna.

00:06:31.858 --> 00:06:33.655
The person on the ground inside?

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:36.793
Yeah. She's the one that attacked
us at the Administration Bureau.

00:06:37.196 --> 00:06:41.100
She's not the mastermind?

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:43.762
Apparently not.

00:06:45.037 --> 00:06:47.335
The Third sure are sloppy.

00:06:49.909 --> 00:06:53.072
What's really going on here?

00:07:06.826 --> 00:07:10.023
She was aware of
Blue Breaker's superior abilities.

00:07:10.396 --> 00:07:14.355
However, she had not thought him to
be so mobile in close-quarter combat.

00:07:15.701 --> 00:07:17.362
Do I... cut him down?

00:07:17.703 --> 00:07:20.604
She asks herself this in the
face of his unexpected actions.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:22.742
If he made even the slightest contact with her,

00:07:22.742 --> 00:07:26.473
her unprotected flesh would
surely be burned and carved away.

00:07:26.712 --> 00:07:27.610
Damn you!

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:43.024
Honoka could not bring herself to draw.

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:47.033
She could cut him down right then.

00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:48.660
And she had a reason to do so.

00:07:49.469 --> 00:07:52.404
But her body refused this.

00:08:06.752 --> 00:08:08.276
Cut me... down!

00:08:10.756 --> 00:08:11.723
Cut me down!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:18.919
Why?

00:08:19.866 --> 00:08:23.597
My voice should be reaching him.

00:08:25.238 --> 00:08:26.603
You should...

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:30.232
...be the same as me!

00:08:34.547 --> 00:08:38.039
Cut me down! Before I kill you!

00:08:39.118 --> 00:08:41.518
Cut me down, please! Hurry!

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:58.762
Why?

00:08:58.971 --> 00:09:01.269
Because it looked like things
would turn out as you predicted.

00:09:01.841 --> 00:09:03.001
As I predicted?

00:09:04.076 --> 00:09:07.409
That thing about how I brought
you here to cut you down.

00:09:08.281 --> 00:09:10.216
It's true, I could cut you down right now.

00:09:10.216 --> 00:09:12.912
No one would complain if I did.

00:09:13.419 --> 00:09:14.750
No one...

00:09:15.321 --> 00:09:16.811
And that made me sad.

00:09:18.958 --> 00:09:21.494
To think that no one would
care if you got killed...

00:09:21.494 --> 00:09:23.121
That's just too awful.

00:09:23.229 --> 00:09:25.754
Such is our lot as autonomous soldiers.

00:09:26.432 --> 00:09:27.763
We are just tools.

00:09:28.301 --> 00:09:31.634
If you were a tool, you'd be the same,
no matter who was using you.

00:09:31.837 --> 00:09:33.306
Even though you'd been hijacked,

00:09:33.306 --> 00:09:35.274
you should've thought nothing of killing me.

00:09:36.842 --> 00:09:37.501
Isn't that right?

00:10:08.274 --> 00:10:11.243
I killed your friend.

00:10:12.044 --> 00:10:15.980
And I have killed many, many others.

00:10:16.849 --> 00:10:20.785
I haven't said a word about
forgiving you for that.

00:10:21.153 --> 00:10:22.279
Then, why?

00:10:23.956 --> 00:10:28.188
Everything that exists in
this world has a purpose.

00:10:28.928 --> 00:10:32.064
If you believe that your purpose is true,

00:10:32.064 --> 00:10:34.555
do not be afraid to contest others.

00:10:35.134 --> 00:10:37.625
Do not be afraid to hurt others.

00:10:39.071 --> 00:10:42.563
But in order to do that, you must know yourself.

00:10:43.309 --> 00:10:44.207
That's...

00:10:44.543 --> 00:10:48.114
Well, I'm just parroting what my grandpa said.

00:10:48.114 --> 00:10:50.116
So, well, there you have it.

00:10:50.116 --> 00:10:53.574
You haven't figured out what
your own purpose is yet.

00:10:53.753 --> 00:10:54.811
Probably.

00:10:55.354 --> 00:10:56.651
Purpose...

00:10:56.756 --> 00:11:02.228
When you've found your purpose,
if you still want to fight me,

00:11:02.228 --> 00:11:04.628
I'll settle things right and proper with you then.

00:11:06.065 --> 00:11:09.899
If your purpose and my purpose clash.

00:11:11.771 --> 00:11:13.830
Are you really sure about this?

00:11:15.307 --> 00:11:18.435
I feel fulfilled by the act of killing people.

00:11:18.844 --> 00:11:22.780
But no matter how I fill that need,
the emptiness quickly returns.

00:11:23.049 --> 00:11:25.347
I feel the desire to kill again.

00:11:25.451 --> 00:11:27.186
And the cycle continues.

00:11:27.186 --> 00:11:28.483
Don't be such a baby!

00:11:28.888 --> 00:11:31.254
You gotta clean up your own messes.

00:11:34.627 --> 00:11:36.720
I won't say that I'll never regret this decision.

00:11:37.329 --> 00:11:40.492
But if possible, I'd rather you didn't make me.

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:43.225
Rona Fauna is alive.

00:11:45.171 --> 00:11:47.071
I sensed her consciousness.

00:11:47.206 --> 00:11:49.542
Rona Fauna is up ahead of us.

00:11:49.542 --> 00:11:49.974
Yeah.

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.540
I sensed her eyes on me, too.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:55.612
Think you can walk?

00:11:59.585 --> 00:12:02.213
Okay, then I guess we'll go check it out.

00:12:22.341 --> 00:12:23.000
Rona!

00:12:25.644 --> 00:12:26.770
How?

00:12:28.247 --> 00:12:29.874
You're awful.

00:12:30.716 --> 00:12:33.810
You were never under my control.

00:12:34.386 --> 00:12:35.318
I'm right, aren't I?

00:12:35.488 --> 00:12:38.855
I only succeeded in cracking
into the system just earlier,

00:12:39.592 --> 00:12:42.356
since your influence had weakened quite a bit.

00:12:42.828 --> 00:12:43.729
You're lying.

00:12:43.729 --> 00:12:45.196
Why would I lie?

00:12:45.331 --> 00:12:46.389
Because...

00:12:46.866 --> 00:12:48.265
...it's you.

00:12:48.934 --> 00:12:51.596
Because you are Joganki and I know you well.

00:12:52.138 --> 00:12:53.105
You give me too much credit!

00:12:53.472 --> 00:12:55.030
No, I'm right!

00:12:58.611 --> 00:12:59.305
Rona!

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.781
Are you awake?

00:13:06.685 --> 00:13:07.174
What is it?

00:13:07.753 --> 00:13:10.916
The system is starting to shut
down from the peripheries.

00:13:12.725 --> 00:13:15.594
You've worked out how the
psychic system functions?

00:13:15.594 --> 00:13:16.720
Hardly.

00:13:17.062 --> 00:13:19.587
But the nanomachines
themselves are mechanical.

00:13:19.665 --> 00:13:23.002
I don't understand Rona Fauna's
communication system,

00:13:23.002 --> 00:13:26.699
but I can analyze the connection
between the nanomachines.

00:13:27.072 --> 00:13:28.096
Huh.

00:13:28.474 --> 00:13:33.512
So, if they've ceased to function,
it means the psychic system is down?

00:13:33.512 --> 00:13:34.479
No.

00:13:34.647 --> 00:13:37.377
What appears to be the core
system is still functioning.

00:13:37.516 --> 00:13:41.220
The peripheral system has probably
just been put in a dormant state.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:43.882
To concentrate all of its energy on the core.

00:13:44.523 --> 00:13:46.821
In other words, Hono is there.

00:13:47.293 --> 00:13:49.318
That would be the logical conclusion.

00:13:50.095 --> 00:13:50.823
A trap?

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:54.959
Don't get any stupid ideas. Leave it to Iks.

00:13:55.868 --> 00:13:57.358
I know.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:02.570
Even if I went, in my sorry state,
I'd only be a hindrance anyway.

00:14:03.909 --> 00:14:04.898
But...

00:14:05.477 --> 00:14:06.712
It's so frustrating.

00:14:06.712 --> 00:14:08.043
Agreed.

00:14:08.848 --> 00:14:09.610
Rona!

00:14:09.882 --> 00:14:12.043
Rona! What's wrong, Rona?!

00:14:19.992 --> 00:14:20.890
Where is it?

00:14:21.393 --> 00:14:23.020
How can I bring her down?

00:14:23.462 --> 00:14:24.622
How?!

00:14:28.534 --> 00:14:29.228
Rona!

00:14:30.803 --> 00:14:31.565
Rona!

00:14:31.904 --> 00:14:33.394
Can you hear me, Rona?!

00:14:33.639 --> 00:14:36.005
Sever the central nervous
system from the network!

00:14:36.141 --> 00:14:37.199
If you keep this up...

00:14:51.290 --> 00:14:52.450
Rona...

00:14:53.425 --> 00:14:55.552
It's not a matter for you to be concerned about.

00:14:57.796 --> 00:14:58.785
Go.

00:14:59.565 --> 00:15:02.966
If you go out that way,
you should meet up with that girl.

00:15:03.702 --> 00:15:06.569
This Honoka, who's come searching for you.

00:15:07.206 --> 00:15:08.298
I can't right now.

00:15:09.108 --> 00:15:10.976
Don't you want to see her?

00:15:10.976 --> 00:15:13.812
Honoka will make it here without any help.

00:15:13.812 --> 00:15:15.541
She won't get lost on the way.

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:20.350
What's more important right now is you!

00:15:20.419 --> 00:15:23.555
Shut down the system and get down from there.

00:15:23.555 --> 00:15:25.250
If you receive medical treatment right away...

00:15:25.958 --> 00:15:27.289
My life can be saved?

00:15:27.793 --> 00:15:28.782
That's right.

00:15:30.863 --> 00:15:34.799
Do you seriously believe that this body
can be restored to the way it was?

00:15:35.234 --> 00:15:37.403
Even if a complete recovery is impossible,

00:15:37.403 --> 00:15:40.304
with The Third's medical technology,
your life could be prolonged.

00:15:40.873 --> 00:15:41.931
And then?

00:15:42.408 --> 00:15:45.536
I live a little longer, and then what?

00:15:48.914 --> 00:15:50.040
I'm sorry.

00:15:50.382 --> 00:15:51.781
That wasn't a fair question.

00:15:52.451 --> 00:15:55.943
I know my condition very well.

00:15:56.088 --> 00:15:58.079
I know it better than anyone.

00:15:59.091 --> 00:16:01.252
I mean, it's not as if I'm sick.

00:16:01.694 --> 00:16:03.525
Nor am I injured.

00:16:04.229 --> 00:16:05.526
Don't talk anymore.

00:16:06.165 --> 00:16:08.895
It's okay. Because this is me.

00:16:09.835 --> 00:16:13.532
A failed member of The Third, Rona Fauna.

00:16:15.741 --> 00:16:16.799
Rona...

00:16:17.543 --> 00:16:19.272
You said it yourself.

00:16:19.511 --> 00:16:22.776
I've launched a war against The Third.

00:16:23.716 --> 00:16:26.776
Who would accept a woman like that?

00:16:27.453 --> 00:16:28.784
I promise you.

00:16:29.221 --> 00:16:33.248
Yes, you're all I've ever had.

00:16:34.026 --> 00:16:38.292
And yet, if I... if she...

00:16:38.864 --> 00:16:42.968
If I did not have this body,
nothing would have happened...

00:16:42.968 --> 00:16:44.833
...and no one would have been hurt.

00:16:45.771 --> 00:16:47.439
Nor would I have caused you to suffer.

00:16:47.439 --> 00:16:49.304
I have not suffered!

00:16:49.575 --> 00:16:53.212
You are only being manipulated
by your own illusions!

00:16:53.212 --> 00:16:55.544
So... So stop this already, Rona!

00:17:00.519 --> 00:17:02.384
You're so bad at lying.

00:17:04.857 --> 00:17:05.624
Rona!

00:17:05.624 --> 00:17:06.488
Go.

00:17:06.792 --> 00:17:08.020
Please.

00:17:08.394 --> 00:17:09.986
Leave me alone.

00:17:10.129 --> 00:17:10.891
Rona!

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:14.221
I loved you, Joganki.

00:17:14.767 --> 00:17:17.736
After all, I know how she felt.

00:17:17.736 --> 00:17:19.727
I love you as well.

00:17:20.472 --> 00:17:23.407
Probably, just as she did.

00:17:32.785 --> 00:17:35.788
Before it all came to an end,

00:17:35.788 --> 00:17:38.824
I wanted to become closer,
in whatever small way I could.

00:17:38.824 --> 00:17:40.426
To you.

00:17:40.426 --> 00:17:41.916
And to her.

00:17:43.762 --> 00:17:46.287
That was my true desire.

00:17:47.633 --> 00:17:50.625
Don't do this, Rona! Come with me!

00:17:50.836 --> 00:17:53.771
This time... This time,
I want to save you for sure!

00:17:54.173 --> 00:17:56.698
You did save her.

00:17:57.976 --> 00:17:58.840
Rona!

00:17:59.178 --> 00:18:00.145
Rona!

00:18:03.816 --> 00:18:04.805
Rona!

00:18:06.218 --> 00:18:07.583
Rona!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:09.544
Farewell.

00:18:15.794 --> 00:18:17.591
The network's been sealed off.

00:18:17.763 --> 00:18:18.320
What?

00:18:18.964 --> 00:18:22.764
The sector that appears to be the
core has been completely isolated.

00:18:23.969 --> 00:18:25.630
What are the probable causes?

00:18:25.871 --> 00:18:28.101
In terms of a system, self-preservation.

00:18:28.273 --> 00:18:29.968
In terms of a system?

00:18:30.476 --> 00:18:33.502
Meaning, if we limit it to a mechanical function.

00:18:34.179 --> 00:18:37.216
On the other hand, if this is a psychic network,

00:18:37.216 --> 00:18:40.310
it could be interpreted to be an
individual living organism.

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:42.921
In which case?

00:18:42.921 --> 00:18:46.220
Psychic matters are for
you and Honoka to handle.

00:18:46.592 --> 00:18:48.924
My, you sure dodged that neatly.

00:18:49.027 --> 00:18:50.429
I'm counting on you.

00:18:50.429 --> 00:18:52.829
I'd like to know what Honoka's situation is.

00:18:53.499 --> 00:18:55.558
So you're putting the lash to the invalid.

00:18:56.401 --> 00:18:57.095
Fine.

00:18:58.604 --> 00:18:59.571
Just you wait.

00:19:14.753 --> 00:19:15.617
What's wrong?

00:19:16.188 --> 00:19:18.588
It appears my system is still unstable.

00:19:18.824 --> 00:19:21.156
Oh man. You don't think you can walk?

00:19:21.827 --> 00:19:25.490
It will take a little time for my
on-board diagnostics to sort this out.

00:19:25.998 --> 00:19:26.987
I see.

00:19:27.566 --> 00:19:28.498
Got it.

00:19:28.734 --> 00:19:31.225
Then, you wait here.

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:33.231
You can come when you're able to move.

00:19:33.672 --> 00:19:34.570
But...

00:19:35.307 --> 00:19:37.298
Disobeying an order means harsh punishment!

00:19:40.045 --> 00:19:41.239
You don't want to be cut down, right?

00:19:43.715 --> 00:19:45.774
Well, I'll be going on ahead.

00:19:47.052 --> 00:19:48.349
Don't push yourself now.

00:20:26.391 --> 00:20:27.323
This is...

00:20:41.907 --> 00:20:44.343
We meet at last...

00:20:44.343 --> 00:20:45.207
I guess?

00:20:47.646 --> 00:20:48.977
I've been waiting.

00:20:56.955 --> 00:20:59.651
I've been wanting to meet you, Honoka.

00:21:00.826 --> 00:21:03.386
My name... You heard it from Joganki?

00:21:03.829 --> 00:21:04.693
Yes.

00:21:04.796 --> 00:21:06.889
And? Where is Joganki?

00:21:07.566 --> 00:21:08.624
That man is dead.

00:21:22.281 --> 00:21:23.441
This is...

00:21:24.483 --> 00:21:27.475
That man... Joganki is dead.

00:21:29.021 --> 00:21:30.716
I killed him.

00:21:53.145 --> 00:21:56.581
An intersection waiting for morning...
Asa o matteiru kousaten ga

00:21:56.581 --> 00:22:00.652
...cradling an abandoned cat that wandered in.
Mayoikonda sute-neko o daiteiru

00:22:00.652 --> 00:22:03.188
Red and green and yellow.
Aka to ao to kiiro

00:22:03.188 --> 00:22:06.214
It is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:06.858 --> 00:22:10.329
Stopping just after dawn,
Akegata-sugi ni furiyanda

00:22:10.329 --> 00:22:14.333
a misty rain made a screen of water.
Kosame ga tsukutta mizu no sukuriin ga

00:22:14.333 --> 00:22:16.902
Until that time when it dries,
Kawaku sono toki made

00:22:16.902 --> 00:22:20.065
it is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:20.138 --> 00:22:23.608
More than small coincidences like that,
Sonna chiisana guuzen yori mo

00:22:23.608 --> 00:22:27.012
the fact that you are there...
Kimi ga soko ni iru koto ga

00:22:27.012 --> 00:22:30.482
...cannot be a small thing, I think.
Chiisai hazu ga nai to omounda

00:22:30.482 --> 00:22:34.111
Even though it's obvious.
Atarimae nandakedo

00:22:35.787 --> 00:22:42.561
It must be sad not to have anyone.
Daremo inai to kanashii koto deshou

00:22:42.561 --> 00:22:49.262
Now, come on out to where the sun is shining.
Saa hi no ataru basho e dete-oide

00:22:49.501 --> 00:22:56.341
Even the several incidents that trouble you...
Kimi o komaraseru ikutsuka no dekigoto mo

00:22:56.341 --> 00:23:01.176
...are coincidences of yesterdays past.
Kinou izen no guuzen nanda yo

00:23:03.148 --> 00:23:08.745
Though, I'm sure you actually know that already.
Hontou wa wakatteru to omou kedo

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:16.889
Preview

00:23:17.763 --> 00:23:19.526
Rona Fauna, covered in blood...

00:23:20.232 --> 00:23:22.530
Her steadfast love was pitiable...

00:23:22.667 --> 00:23:26.159
...and her emotions that would
ever fall short became lost.

00:23:26.872 --> 00:23:31.209
And this out-of-control soul,
meaning to wipe out everything,

00:23:31.209 --> 00:23:34.645
activated the wormhole driver once again.

00:23:35.781 --> 00:23:39.551
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:39.551 --> 00:23:42.053
episode 22, "The Mirage of
a Soul Never to Return".

00:23:42.053 --> 00:23:43.321
The Mirage of a Soul Never to Return
episode 22, "The Mirage of
a Soul Never to Return".

00:23:43.321 --> 00:23:44.913
